      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T17:57:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is unique about your r8152 driver? Why can\u0027t you use the upstream version?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "31660f9bae78d9d56044a74b8a9f7a4e6275ed00",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "505dee5d_5cb7e392",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 12,
      "author": {
        "id": 1981633
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T18:02:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Furthermore, as GKI has an upstream-first policy, can\u0027t you upstream the features you require and backport to GKI as necessary?",
      "parentUuid": "c965ee49_82755608",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "31660f9bae78d9d56044a74b8a9f7a4e6275ed00",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d76b777c_08a24576",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
